Package: snapp
Title: Explore File Snapshots Over Time
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Nash", "Delcamp", email = "nash.delcamp@simulations-plus.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A Shiny application for comparing file snapshots across time using
    pluggable snapshot sources (git and generalized filesystem snapshots), with a
    diff carousel for exploring a file's history.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/nash-delcamp-slp/snapp
BugReports: https://github.com/nash-delcamp-slp/snapp/issues
